   {
    "attributes": [
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz3iF",
      "name": "Why I'm standing",
      "value": "I'm passionate about effecting meaningful & positive change at both the grassroots and systemic levels, for all of us – human and more-than-human – motivated by the saying, \"Be the change you want to see in the world.\" I cannot stand by and do nothing when faced with injustice. I am particularly focused on advocating for our most vulnerable, marginalised, and oppressed communities, including takatāpui & trans, disabled people, women, mana whenua, and nonhuman animals."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz3kQ",
      "name": "About me",
      "value": "I'm highly analytical and resilient, with demonstrated experience in managing demanding workloads (e.g. FT work and FTE study for 4+ years). I lead with compassion and always attempt to establish mutual understanding. I'm not afraid to admit when I'm wrong and take accountability for mistakes. I share a variety of lived experiences with some of our marginalised communities (e.g., mental health & neurodivergence, hidden disabilities, queer & LGBTQIA+ rights, family violence, workers' unions)"
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz3mb",
      "name": "Priority 1",
      "value": "Affordable Lives-taxing the rich, lowering power, grocery, transport and other bills."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz3om",
      "name": "Priority 2",
      "value": "Healthy Nature-clean, swimmable rivers and beaches, and drinkable water."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz3qx",
      "name": "Priority 3",
      "value": "Decisions in your hands, not lobbyists and corporations-making sure your voice is heard."
     }
    ],
