   {
    "attributes": [
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz4LR",
      "name": "Why I'm standing",
      "value": "I'm here to serve.  I work tirelessly to make our region better, helping local families, raising up businesses, and fighting for support.  I served 23 years in the military, and I'm proud of delivering for Kapiti as an MP, like the new cancer clinic.  I'm asking for three more years, so we can improve healthcare, cap council rates, lift achievement in schools, and make life more affordable with no new taxes.  Please vote for me."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz4Nc",
      "name": "About me",
      "value": "I put people first. I've fought for firefighters, families, retirees and businesses. I have delivered tangible results locally: help with school transport, access to housing, solving immigration challenges. I don't just hold the party line; I help shape it. I have always put our region and our people first, even in the tough battles. I have decades of service experience in the military, not-for-profits and community groups; master's and bachelor's degrees; and three years as an MP."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz4Pn",
      "name": "Priority 1",
      "value": "Improving healthcare: Delivering more services faster and closer to home, like the new cancer clinic."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz4Ry",
      "name": "Priority 2",
      "value": "Making life more affordable: cap council rates, attract tourists and the economic growth they bring."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz4U9",
      "name": "Priority 3",
      "value": "Supporting people one-on-one: it's not just big-ticket items; it's helping local families every day."
     }
    ],
